ōng","gloss":"master"},{"hanzi":"一门外语","pinyin":"yī mén wài yǔ","gloss":"a foreign language"},{"hanzi":"需要","pinyin":"xū yào","gloss":"require"},{"hanzi":"长期练习。","pinyin":"cháng qī liàn xí.","gloss":"long-term practice"}]}]}
